{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/01/5757720/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"E.T.色なしバージョン！\n絵を描くのすきです。\nあまり言ってなかったけど。\nあ、ブログではたまに言ってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"細いペンやシャーペンで\n細かい絵を描くのすきです。！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握に行ったみなさん\n楽しかったですかーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとも私がいなくて\n寂しかったですかーーーーっ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私は体育祭でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/01/5757720/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"疲れたー\nけど、楽しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、友達とあんな風に\n熱くなることはないだろうな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家からトマトジュースを持ってきて\nお昼の時間に飲もうと思ったら\nすっごくぬるくなってて\n飲むのが大変でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/01/5757720/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のボケが激しすぎる話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仕事終わりに服を買って\n電車に乗りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつの間に手から服の入った袋を\n落としてしまったみたいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに気づいた\n目の前に座ってた人が\n落としましたよ\nと伝えてくれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーここまでは普通ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は足元に落ちた袋を見ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでか\n自分のじゃないと思ってしまって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違います私のじゃないです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って断って\n自ら網棚に置いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰ってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最寄り駅の改札出て\n買った服がないことに気づきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はあああああああああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな大ボケかましたのはじめてだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫かな。私"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはこんな経験ありませんか！\n真夏とかよくありそう！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/01/5757720/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/01/5757720/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/01/5757720/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近笑顔が少ないと言われるので"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/01/5757720/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/01/5757720/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑ってみーたーよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらくは大きい画像にしてみます。\n押すと大きくなる画像は\n画質少し良いけど期間が過ぎると\n見れないらしいので...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甲乙つけがたいですな！\nどちらも同じくらいの票数でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご意見ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/01/5757720/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}